     "detail": {
      "reason": "People who already held temporary protection and kept it without a break are not affected by the new requirement. Protection runs to 4 March 2028.",
      "caveat": "The decision protects people who held protection before or on 4 August 2026 and keep it in the same member state. Whether the exemption carries over when you move to another EU state is not verified yet.",
